{"articleNo":"92696","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=92696&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"“6시그마 GB과정(생산제조부문)” 취업연계형 집중교육과정(대학교육역량강화사업) 교육생 모집 마감","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2013.10.02","hit":"3177","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">안녕하세요?</span></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">인적자원개발센터 김동혁 입니다.</span></span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p></span><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">우선 “6시그마 GB과정(생산제조부문)” 취업연계형 집중교육과정(대학교육역량강화사업) 교육생 모집에 많은 관심과 신청에 감사드립니다.</span></span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p></span><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">현재까지 신청한 인원이 정원을 크게 초과 하여 신청접수를 마감하도록 하겠습니다.</span></span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p></span><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">교육인원을 리스트화하여 선정된 신청자에게는 학교게시판 공고와 함께 문자로 예치금 납부 안내를 하도록 하겠습니다.</span></span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p></span><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\" lang=\"EN-US\"><u><font color=\"#0900ff\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">* 예치금 입금이 완료되어야 최종 선정됨을 알려드립니다.</span></strong></font></u></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><!--?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">신청하신 모든 학생들에게 다시한번 감사의 말씀 전합니다.</span></span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p></span><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 인적자원개발센터 김동혁 드림 -</span></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
